(`mixdog-office-com`, `mixdog-office-pdf` and `mixdog-ooxml` are also named by nr-office-engine-snapshot.wire: add each once.
`mixdog-pdf` gives `FontEnv`, `mixdog-raster` `SvgFonts`, which a PDF create writes with. None of them depends on mixdog-office.
